@startuml
title Sequence - UC-04 Check-in khi lên xe (QR + offline)
actor "Sinh viên App" as StudentApp
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Check-in Service" as Checkin
database "DB" as DB
participant "Notification Service" as Notif
participant "Driver App" as DriverApp
participant "Kafka" as Kafka

== Online flow ==
StudentApp -> API : Scan QR (tripId, token)
API -> Auth : validate access token
Auth --> API : OK
API -> Checkin : validate QR, check trip window
Checkin -> DB : read Trip/Enrollment
DB --> Checkin : data
Checkin -> DB : insert CheckIn(record)
Checkin --> API : success
API -> Notif : send "check-in success"
Notif -> DriverApp : push (optional)
API --> StudentApp : success message
API -> Kafka : publish checkin event

== Offline alternative ==
StudentApp -> StudentApp : store check-in locally (no network)
... Later when network available ...
StudentApp -> API : sync pending check-ins
API -> Checkin : validate & persist
Checkin -> DB : upsert
API --> StudentApp : sync result
API -> Kafka : publish checkin events
@enduml